msgid ""
"Output gain (solid, dB) and filtered-path phase (faint, degrees) at the sweep midpoint. The "
"shaded range shows the LFO limits; drag its edges to adjust. Depth and Feedback shape the output "
"response; Rate controls sweep speed."
